      { badge: "SPORT", title: "Dark horses shine on the long jump runway", dek: "First-year students delivered surprise performances in field events.", body: "HANGZHOU — A string of first-year students posted personal bests in the long jump, sending sand flying as the cheer squads roared. Teachers praised the depth of newcomers and predicted close battles in tomorrow's track finals." }
